  "name": "Issue 1115: Cinderstorm Runes makes Hurricane and Smolder deal 50% more below 20% health",
  "contract": [
    "Cinderstorm Runes 706458 (Riftblade talent) reads 'Hurricane and Smolder now deal $s1% more damage against",
    "enemies below 20% maximum health.' Its only effect is aura 112 with the copied selector 20007",
    "(ASCENSION_CLASSMASK_AURASTATE_DAMAGE), MiscValueB 2 (AURA_STATE_HEALTHLESS_20_PERCENT), BasePoints 49 +",
    "DieSides 1 = 50 on family 38 mask0 0x200 (Smolder ranks) and mask2 0x4 (the Hurricane strike 645437). No",
    "override-script handler reads selector 20007, so the talent did nothing. Converted to native aura 303",
    "(damage versus aura state) with the class-mask scope, as the Ranger and Primalist contracts do, the weapon",
    "damage bonus of Smolder 801087 and the strike is x1.5 while the enemy is below 20% and x1 above it.",
    "Runeblade 707141 and a Runemaster without the talent are unchanged."
  ],
